===Format===
* '''Group Stage:'''
** Four double-elimination (GSL) format groups
*** Each group has 4 teams
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Top three teams from each group advance to the Playoffs:
*** Group stage winners advance to the '''Quarterfinals'''
*** Group stage runners-up advance to the '''Round of 12''' as the ''High Seeds''
*** Group stage 3<sup>rd</sup> place teams advance to the '''Round of 12''' as the ''Low Seeds''

* '''Playoffs:'''
** Single-Elimination bracket
** All matches ''(excl. Grand Final)'' are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** The Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo5}}

